      "transcript_text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with recovering well after bypass surgery do well once it's treated properly. I want an ECG done, that's for post-operative review. Walk daily, no heavy lifting for six weeks and no driving until you are cleared. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference. Let's hold off on blood tests for now, and if there's no change in two weeks we can revisit it.",
